# tests/core/truncate.cases: ARGS | STDIN | DIFF (docs/specs/2026-11-06-c-core.md section 6, CT-5). STDIN is a file of
# tests/core/tree or - for none; DIFF is a row of tests/core/DIFFS.md or - when busybox must agree. The tree is compared after each case.
-s 0 text.txt | - | -
-s 10 text.txt | - | -
-s 5000 nonl.txt | - | -
-s 1k new | - | -
-s 1K new | - | -
-s 1M new | - | -
-s 1kB new | - | -
-s 1MB new | - | -
-s 01k new | - | -
-c -s 5 new | - | -
-c -s 5 text.txt | - | -
-s 3 text.txt nonl.txt new | - | -
-s 3 missing/x text.txt | - | -
-s 5 look | - | -
-s +5 text.txt | - | D-3
-s -5 text.txt | - | D-3
-s 1m new | - | D-3
-s 1T new | - | D-3
-s x new | - | D-3
text.txt | - | D-3
-s 5 | - | D-3
